OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer guilty of raping
OL,4,Ateenage girl and woman in Shetland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has been found guilty
OL,7,Fof raping a teenage girl and a woman in
OL,8,FShetland.
OL,10,FCarmichael John Williamson - known as
OL,11,FJohn Williamson ` was found to have
OL,12,Fengaged in sexual activity with a girl
OL,13,Fwhen she was under the age of 16 in
OL,14,F2014 and raped her between 2014 and
OL,15,F2015.
OL,17,FWilliamson, of Burra, also raped a
OL,18,Fsecond woman in 2020 and again in 2022
OL,19,Fwhen she was intoxicated and unable to
OL,20,Fconsent.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
